Discover the ultimate SAGA Festival 2024 experience with the SAGA Festival Official App.

The SAGA Festival App will be your digital guide before, during, and after the festival: Get connected and inspired for 3 days of the biggest music festival in Bucharest.

•⁠  ⁠Discover the lineup of 150+ artists;
•⁠  ⁠See the full schedule of SAGA 2024;
•⁠  ⁠Create your lineup to make sure you don’t miss your favorites;
•⁠  ⁠Stay connected to everything that’s going on with the News section;
•⁠  ⁠Be the first one to get tickets & register for future events.

Download the app for free and enjoy the SAGA experience!
